211 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 81 0 R
/T (This arrangement divides work in a hierarchical manner. The sensor chips perform conversion of physical quantities into digital values; the flight controller performs the time-critical control computation; the ESCs perform fast commutation of the motor phases; and the companion computer performs non-time-critical but heavy computation. Each unit has a clear responsibility, and the interconnections between units are well-defined digital interfaces.)
/E (This arrangement divides work in a hierarchical manner. The sensor chips perform conversion of physical quantities into digital values; the flight controller performs the time-critical control computation; the ESCs perform fast commutation of the motor phases; and the companion computer performs non-time-critical but heavy computation. Each unit has a clear responsibility, and the interconnections between units are well-defined digital interfaces.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
