/Title (Another important feature is the interrupt controller. The CPU does not continuously check each device \(polling\). Instead, a device signals the CPU through an interrupt request, the CPU saves its present state, executes a short interrupt service routine, and then resumes the interrupted work. Interrupts are used when a new IMU sample is ready, when a byte is received from the GPS, or when a timer period has elapsed.)
