875 0 obj
<<
/Title (This arrangement divides work in a hierarchical manner. The sensor chips perform conversion of physical quantities into digital values; the flight controller performs the time-critical control computation; the ESCs perform fast commutation of the motor phases; and the companion computer performs non-time-critical but heavy computation. Each unit has a clear responsibility, and the interconnections between units are well-defined digital interfaces.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 858 0 R
/Prev 874 0 R
>>
endobj
