/Title (A key feature for a drone is the floating-point unit \(FPU\). Control algorithms and sensor fusion involve many multiplications, divisions, trigonometric functions and square roots on fractional numbers. An FPU executes single-precision floating-point operations in hardware in a few clock cycles, whereas a processor without one must emulate them in software, which is many times slower. Hardware multiply-accumulate and DSP instructions further speed up filters and matrix calculations.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 846 0 R
